<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:s="https://wvusports.com/services/xml_schema/story" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title /><link>https://wvusports.com/rss/</link><description /><atom:link href="https://wvusports.com/rss" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><language>en-us</language><ttl>60</ttl><item><title>WVU vs. Kansas Game Time Changed to 3:30 p.m. on ESPN2</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/13/football-wvu-vs-kansas-game-time-changed-to-3-30-pm-on-espn2</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/13/football-wvu-vs-kansas-game-time-changed-to-3-30-pm-on-espn2</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="KUTimeChange3:30" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/13/UpdatedKUTimeWebsize.jpeg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that due to the national FAA ground stop impacting team travel, WVU's Nov. 14 home football game against Kansas will now be played on Saturday at 3:30 p.m. ET. and will be televised on ESPN2.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/13/UpdatedKUTimeWebsize.jpeg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/13/UpdatedKUTimeWebsize.jpeg"><media:title>KUTimeChange3:30</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/13/UpdatedKUTimeWebsize.jpeg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:08:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59695</s:story_id></item><item><title>Big 12 To Monitor Saturday’s Football Schedule</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/13/big-12-to-monitor-saturdays-football-schedule</lin